1
00:00:02,830 --> 00:00:05,340
[Episode 12]

2
00:00:05,340 --> 00:00:08,100
Do it lightly! He'll wake up.

3
00:00:08,100 --> 00:00:09,580
Okay, I got it.

4
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:17,420
Anyways, is Uncle really mad at us?

5
00:00:17,420 --> 00:00:21,900
Yeah, because we kept asking him
not to go to Australia,

6
00:00:21,900 --> 00:00:24,520
he got annoyed with us.

7
00:00:25,310 --> 00:00:27,630
He said we annoy him?

8
00:00:27,630 --> 00:00:30,820
Wouldn't you be annoyed?
Always making him mad and stuff.

9
00:00:30,820 --> 00:00:32,520
I don't do that anymore!

10
00:00:32,520 --> 00:00:34,600
I won't make him mad from now on.

11
00:00:35,530 --> 00:00:39,150
Good. You better be good from now on.

12
00:00:40,190 --> 00:00:41,640
Why don't you be good yourself, stupid?

13
00:00:41,640 --> 00:00:45,050
Shhh! Uncle might wake up!

14
00:00:45,050 --> 00:00:48,040
It'll be all your fault if Uncle runs away.

15
00:00:48,040 --> 00:00:52,410
I'm sorry. I was wrong.

16
00:00:53,870 --> 00:00:56,310
You make me so angry.

17
00:00:58,120 --> 00:01:04,240
I'll be good from now on

18
00:01:04,240 --> 00:01:06,550
so he doesn't go to Australia.

19
00:01:48,730 --> 00:01:50,710
Find a replacement immediately.

20
00:01:50,710 --> 00:01:55,060
Seeing his face is torture.

21
00:02:14,930 --> 00:02:17,850
Who are you?

22
00:02:20,760 --> 00:02:22,790
I'm Mr. Choi Yun's manager.

23
00:02:23,460 --> 00:02:27,690
I'm Choi Yun's manager.

24
00:02:27,690 --> 00:02:34,500
Mr. Kang told me I start work today.

25
00:02:35,940 --> 00:02:38,530
Is something wrong?

26
00:03:25,360 --> 00:03:27,180
I should at least say goodbye.

27
00:03:41,540 --> 00:03:42,770
Eunchae.

28
00:03:45,680 --> 00:03:47,020
Eunchae. Eunchae.

29
00:03:53,140 --> 00:03:54,570
Eunchae!

30
00:03:59,230 --> 00:04:00,540
Eunchae?

31
00:04:00,540 --> 00:04:03,520
Mr. Cha? What's wrong with her?

32
00:04:04,180 --> 00:04:06,550
- I'm not sure.
- What?

33
00:04:06,550 --> 00:04:10,630
What were you doing neglecting her
to the brink of death?

34
00:04:10,630 --> 00:04:11,760
What?

35
00:04:11,760 --> 00:04:18,300
Are other people's lives not as important as your son's?

36
00:04:25,799 --> 00:04:27,868
My gosh.

37
00:04:33,440 --> 00:04:34,750
Get out of the way!

38
00:04:35,320 --> 00:04:37,430
Where's the doctor?

39
00:04:37,430 --> 00:04:38,940
Where's the doctor?

40
00:04:38,940 --> 00:04:40,660
What's the problem?

41
00:04:48,960 --> 00:04:51,190
She's got a fever from stress.

42
00:04:51,190 --> 00:04:54,360
We'll alleviate her fever first since it's too high.

43
00:04:54,360 --> 00:04:56,940
Nurse, get the fever medication.

44
00:05:06,850 --> 00:05:10,570
Why is that bastard here again?

45
00:05:10,570 --> 00:05:12,280
Who are you talking about?

46
00:05:12,280 --> 00:05:15,520
Mr. Cha! Cha Muhyeok, that jerk!

47
00:05:15,520 --> 00:05:20,320
Didn't Mr. Kang tell you? Can't you get the job done?

48
00:05:20,320 --> 00:05:24,620
- Maybe no one told him yet.
- Then inform him right now!

49
00:05:24,620 --> 00:05:28,660
What did he just say to me? Who does he think he is?

50
00:05:28,660 --> 00:05:31,460
- Where is Mr. Cha?
- ER...

51
00:05:32,720 --> 00:05:35,070
He's in the ER with Eunchae.

52
00:05:37,090 --> 00:05:39,990
Eunchae is sick.

53
00:05:39,990 --> 00:05:41,090
What?

54
00:05:41,090 --> 00:05:43,830
Sorry. I'm sorry, but

55
00:05:43,830 --> 00:05:46,052
I told her to go home,

56
00:05:46,052 --> 00:05:50,680
but she kept insisting that
she wanted to be with Yun.

57
00:05:53,210 --> 00:05:55,410
Anyways.

58
00:05:55,410 --> 00:05:59,810
There's something going on between
Muhyeok and Eunchae, right?

59
00:06:00,780 --> 00:06:02,950
Something feels off.

60
00:06:02,950 --> 00:06:06,930
Cha Muhyeok has a crush on Eunchae, maybe?

61
00:06:06,930 --> 00:06:08,370
Am I right?

62
00:06:44,370 --> 00:06:46,900
Don't tell Eunchae about Muhyeok.

63
00:06:49,330 --> 00:06:58,380
Don't ever tell Eunchae that Muhyeok is dying.

64
00:07:11,490 --> 00:07:12,600
Muhyeok.

65
00:07:18,460 --> 00:07:19,980
Can I talk to you?

66
00:07:30,300 --> 00:07:31,450
Muhyeok.

67
00:07:37,210 --> 00:07:38,510
Muhyeok.

68
00:07:41,950 --> 00:07:43,240
Muhyeok.

69
00:07:45,760 --> 00:07:47,550
- Hey, Yun!
- Muhyeok.

70
00:07:47,550 --> 00:07:50,500
- Yun!
- Muhyeok.

71
00:07:50,500 --> 00:07:52,020
Yun!

72
00:07:52,020 --> 00:07:53,940
Yun! Yun!

73
00:07:56,150 --> 00:07:58,190
Help!

74
00:07:58,990 --> 00:08:00,790
Yun, are you okay?

75
00:08:40,830 --> 00:08:43,310
- I'm going to kill him.
- Calm down.

76
00:08:43,310 --> 00:08:46,650
I'm really going to kill him. Don't stop me.

77
00:08:46,650 --> 00:08:48,470
I'll definitely kill him today, that jerk.

78
00:08:48,470 --> 00:08:50,630
Even if you don't kill him...

79
00:08:50,630 --> 00:08:52,360
He'll die soon anyway.

80
00:09:00,870 --> 00:09:03,030
Even if you don't kill him,

81
00:09:05,750 --> 00:09:09,540
he's dying anyway. Don't do it.

82
00:09:12,520 --> 00:09:14,470
What are you talking about?

83
00:09:43,980 --> 00:09:45,600
Are you okay, Blockhead?

84
00:09:46,510 --> 00:09:48,990
You scared me! I thought you were gonna die!

85
00:09:51,900 --> 00:09:53,050
Eunchae.

86
00:09:54,560 --> 00:09:55,720
Eunchae.

87
00:09:57,220 --> 00:09:58,630
Eunchae.

88
00:10:02,650 --> 00:10:04,040
Eunchae.

89
00:10:07,950 --> 00:10:09,370
Eunchae.

90
00:10:26,680 --> 00:10:32,140
If I do one good thing before I die,
maybe I won't go to hell.

91
00:10:32,140 --> 00:10:36,480
And it will be good for you, Yun, and Yun's mom.

92
00:10:36,480 --> 00:10:41,230
I'll never forget your kindness as long as I live.

93
00:12:08,600 --> 00:12:13,380
Is that your way of life?

94
00:12:14,260 --> 00:12:17,180
You'll sacrifice your own daughter

95
00:12:17,180 --> 00:12:22,150
for the sake of Yun?

96
00:12:22,150 --> 00:12:24,310
Is that what you think?

97
00:12:26,850 --> 00:12:32,840
Didn't you hear her moaning
from being sick from exhaustion?

98
00:12:34,890 --> 00:12:36,720
Watch what you're saying, Mr. Cha.

99
00:12:36,720 --> 00:12:39,670
Were you always so loyal?

100
00:12:41,920 --> 00:12:50,700
You're like a dog.
Doing as your master tells you to do.

101
00:13:06,270 --> 00:13:09,240
Are you just going in to change?

102
00:13:09,240 --> 00:13:10,400
Yeah.

103
00:13:16,430 --> 00:13:17,740
Mr. Song.

104
00:13:17,740 --> 00:13:18,890
Yes?

105
00:13:21,210 --> 00:13:25,850
What I'm about to say right now...

106
00:13:28,480 --> 00:13:30,670
Just listen. Don't take it the wrong way.

107
00:13:32,710 --> 00:13:33,720
Okay.

108
00:13:35,880 --> 00:13:38,170
Well, I don't care what you think of it.

109
00:13:38,170 --> 00:13:40,600
You can even throw a rock at me.

110
00:13:40,600 --> 00:13:43,010
I'd gladly be stabbed for it, even. For saying this...

111
00:13:47,470 --> 00:13:49,390
About Mr. Cha.

112
00:13:51,540 --> 00:13:58,540
There's no way of helping him?
Is he just waiting to die?

113
00:14:01,190 --> 00:14:03,560
That's what I heard.

114
00:14:03,560 --> 00:14:09,970
Then if he's going to die...

115
00:14:11,510 --> 00:14:14,450
Could he help Yun before he dies?

116
00:14:16,140 --> 00:14:17,180
What?

117
00:14:18,070 --> 00:14:21,700
I know saying this is a sin, but...

118
00:14:21,700 --> 00:14:27,680
I've asked Mr. Kang for Mr. Cha's health records.

119
00:14:27,680 --> 00:14:31,540
Detailed diagnostic analysis is
needed to be sure, but...

120
00:14:31,540 --> 00:14:36,240
Fortunately, he has the same blood type as Yun.

121
00:14:36,240 --> 00:14:39,480
What do you mean?

122
00:14:39,480 --> 00:14:41,840
If he can save Yun...

123
00:14:41,840 --> 00:14:44,350
I can give him anything he wants.

124
00:14:44,350 --> 00:14:47,850
I'll even give him my entire fortune.

125
00:14:47,850 --> 00:14:50,730
The body will become dirt after he dies anyway.

126
00:14:57,730 --> 00:15:01,250
I told you. You can throw rocks at me.

127
00:15:01,250 --> 00:15:06,610
What a horrible person I am!
I said I'd gladly let you kill me!

128
00:15:08,470 --> 00:15:12,430
I'll take any sort of punishment!

129
00:15:57,040 --> 00:15:58,410
Mom.

130
00:16:02,370 --> 00:16:04,040
Mom.

131
00:16:29,970 --> 00:16:31,200
Galchi!

132
00:16:33,780 --> 00:16:35,370
Kim Galchi!

133
00:16:35,370 --> 00:16:36,540
Yes?

134
00:16:37,980 --> 00:16:41,040
How do I look? Handsome?

135
00:16:41,040 --> 00:16:42,160
Yes.

136
00:16:43,880 --> 00:16:47,520
Am I hotter than the singer Choi Yun?

137
00:16:51,280 --> 00:16:53,460
Is Choi Yun hotter?

138
00:17:01,380 --> 00:17:04,870
Blockhead! Good morning.

139
00:17:30,160 --> 00:17:34,150
You're okay. You're okay.

140
00:17:35,560 --> 00:17:37,660
You're okay.

141
00:17:44,270 --> 00:17:46,740
You're okay, right, Eunchae?

142
00:18:01,700 --> 00:18:02,910
This one.

143
00:18:04,870 --> 00:18:06,590
Wow. It's so pretty.

144
00:18:09,370 --> 00:18:11,430
I'll take this one.

145
00:18:11,430 --> 00:18:15,230
It's for my son's engagement. Please wrap it nicely.

146
00:18:15,230 --> 00:18:19,100
And let's see that one as well.

147
00:18:19,100 --> 00:18:20,270
- This one?
- Yes.

148
00:18:21,870 --> 00:18:25,320
You asked for it to be served in the ice cream?

149
00:18:25,320 --> 00:18:30,120
Mom! You've watched too many movies!

150
00:18:31,180 --> 00:18:34,770
Oh, yeah. You are an actress.

151
00:18:36,100 --> 00:18:37,990
Okay.

152
00:18:39,040 --> 00:18:43,570
Thank you, Mom. Love you.

153
00:19:01,660 --> 00:19:04,010
Did you wait long?

154
00:19:04,010 --> 00:19:05,800
You must be hungry.

155
00:19:05,800 --> 00:19:07,480
Eunchae.

156
00:19:07,480 --> 00:19:09,350
I wanna eat something delicious.

157
00:19:09,350 --> 00:19:13,000
Hospital food isn't so bad if you learn to enjoy it.

158
00:19:14,210 --> 00:19:17,760
Let's go outside. I want some fresh air.

159
00:19:17,760 --> 00:19:20,330
You shouldn't go outside.

160
00:19:21,710 --> 00:19:27,460
I'll be more sick by being in this bed every day.

161
00:19:29,740 --> 00:19:31,270
Just this once.

162
00:19:45,330 --> 00:19:49,600
Yes. I got everything.

163
00:19:51,950 --> 00:19:53,950
I'm going down right now.

164
00:19:53,950 --> 00:19:57,310
You're still here?

165
00:19:57,310 --> 00:19:59,570
Mr. Kang...

166
00:20:03,700 --> 00:20:05,750
Said to keep showing up for work...

167
00:20:08,060 --> 00:20:10,330
Leave these with me.

168
00:20:10,330 --> 00:20:15,620
And go get breastfed by your mom some more,
you baby.

169
00:20:15,620 --> 00:20:16,960
But...

170
00:20:16,960 --> 00:20:18,930
- Get going.
- Yes?

171
00:20:18,930 --> 00:20:20,510
Get going!

172
00:20:21,930 --> 00:20:23,000
Yes.

173
00:20:23,470 --> 00:20:25,030
Are you sure you're okay?

174
00:20:25,030 --> 00:20:26,930
I'll be fine.

175
00:20:26,930 --> 00:20:30,300
As long as you're with me, I'll be okay.

176
00:20:42,580 --> 00:20:47,730
That little new manager left
to be breastfed by his mom.

177
00:20:48,530 --> 00:20:53,030
When he's old enough, I'll give him the position.

178
00:20:56,220 --> 00:20:58,100
Where are you two going?

179
00:21:00,287 --> 00:21:06,693
♪ Everyone lives like that since they are so tired ♪

180
00:21:06,693 --> 00:21:09,067
♪ They live like they are dead ♪

181
00:21:09,067 --> 00:21:11,795
♪ In a world where dying is better than living, oh no ♪

182
00:21:11,795 --> 00:21:17,804
♪ Wringing the heart like wet laundry ♪

183
00:21:17,804 --> 00:21:21,924
♪ I want to throw away in water
this body, nose and throat ♪

184
00:21:22,859 --> 00:21:36,258
♪ They live like they are dead
thanks to music and magazines ♪

185
00:22:00,300 --> 00:22:01,430
Mr. Song.

186
00:22:03,060 --> 00:22:07,620
Come here. Do you think it will fit her?

187
00:22:07,620 --> 00:22:08,660
Who?

188
00:22:08,660 --> 00:22:13,670
Muhyeok's sister. The slow girl.

189
00:22:13,670 --> 00:22:15,780
Do you think it will look good on her?

190
00:22:17,440 --> 00:22:20,610
I'm just trying to be nice.

191
00:22:20,610 --> 00:22:26,390
It's just that I accused her by mistake.

192
00:22:26,390 --> 00:22:29,970
I feel sorry, so I was going to apologize.

193
00:22:31,690 --> 00:22:34,030
I'll take all these.

194
00:22:34,030 --> 00:22:35,450
Yes, ma'am.

195
00:22:36,470 --> 00:22:39,440
I bought some fish, beef,
and fruits at the grocery store.

196
00:22:39,440 --> 00:22:41,360
Can you load them into the car?

197
00:22:43,090 --> 00:22:45,440
It's not for any favors.

198
00:22:45,440 --> 00:22:49,700
I'm just going to simply apologize.

199
00:22:49,700 --> 00:22:52,660
Apologize. An apology.

200
00:22:52,660 --> 00:22:56,950
You know what an apology is, don't you?

201
00:23:21,850 --> 00:23:25,420
I've to go to the bathroom. Wait for me inside.

202
00:23:25,420 --> 00:23:26,890
Okay.

203
00:23:44,330 --> 00:23:46,550
What can you do for Eunchae?

204
00:23:50,330 --> 00:23:53,080
What can you do for her?

205
00:23:56,680 --> 00:23:58,180
If it were me,

206
00:23:59,240 --> 00:24:03,520
if I thought I couldn't do anything
for the girl I loved,

207
00:24:04,840 --> 00:24:07,390
I would give her up.

208
00:24:09,000 --> 00:24:11,100
I think that's being a real man.

209
00:24:43,390 --> 00:24:45,700
I'm going to propose to Eunchae today.

210
00:24:48,150 --> 00:24:49,800
What's wrong with this?

211
00:24:53,580 --> 00:24:55,430
Can you do this for me?

212
00:25:09,690 --> 00:25:13,580
Why? Wanna kill me?

213
00:25:17,640 --> 00:25:23,110
If I were that easy to kill, I'd have died long ago.

214
00:25:24,131 --> 00:25:28,510
This color sucks.

215
00:25:28,510 --> 00:25:29,880
It sucks.

216
00:26:20,640 --> 00:26:30,480
♪ You are the only woman for me ♪

217
00:26:32,310 --> 00:26:44,770
♪ I miss you constantly, you're only for me ♪

218
00:26:49,600 --> 00:26:59,080
♪ You're the light of my life ♪

219
00:27:01,440 --> 00:27:13,590
♪ You shed light on my dark and empty world ♪

220
00:27:18,790 --> 00:27:33,820
♪ I haven't even been able to buy you clothes or
hold your now rough hands ♪

221
00:27:33,820 --> 00:27:41,940
♪ Please, can you forgive me ♪

222
00:27:41,940 --> 00:27:50,870
♪ I'm sorry you had to meet someone like me ♪

223
00:28:02,300 --> 00:28:04,660
Yun! Yun!

224
00:28:06,380 --> 00:28:07,530
Yun!

225
00:28:08,660 --> 00:28:09,470
Yun!

226
00:28:09,470 --> 00:28:11,530
Are you okay?

227
00:28:11,530 --> 00:28:14,230
Yun! Yun!

228
00:28:14,230 --> 00:28:16,500
What am I going to do?

229
00:28:37,600 --> 00:28:41,130
Aren't you going to help me with this?

230
00:28:41,130 --> 00:28:44,130
You're the worst ever.

231
00:28:44,130 --> 00:28:46,880
I told you I came to apologize. Stop judging me.

232
00:28:46,880 --> 00:28:49,940
Why can't you just take it for what it is?

233
00:28:51,560 --> 00:28:54,710
Fine. Fine. You're so good.

234
00:28:54,710 --> 00:28:58,000
And I'm such a bad witch who deserves to be stoned.

235
00:28:58,000 --> 00:29:02,100
And you're the moral-rich Buddha.

236
00:29:02,100 --> 00:29:07,940
I got my ticket to hell. You go on to heaven.

237
00:29:07,940 --> 00:29:10,260
Yes. You'll go to heaven!

238
00:29:10,260 --> 00:29:14,040
Are you really not going to help me?

239
00:30:00,660 --> 00:30:05,520
Why do they live in such a poor area?
There's not even a road!

240
00:30:05,520 --> 00:30:07,690
Making me suffer.

241
00:30:10,360 --> 00:30:15,290
I've been treating him too nicely.

242
00:30:15,290 --> 00:30:19,010
A servant should only be treated as a servant.

243
00:30:19,010 --> 00:30:21,370
I've been treating him too nicely.

244
00:30:21,370 --> 00:30:25,140
If we weren't going to be in-laws, why I'd...

245
00:30:26,970 --> 00:30:30,200
Where on earth is building 16-1?

246
00:31:00,390 --> 00:31:04,160
So what gifts do you want from Santa?

247
00:31:04,160 --> 00:31:10,790
I want dolls, shoes, clothes, and snacks.

248
00:31:10,790 --> 00:31:12,190
How about you, Galchi?

249
00:31:12,190 --> 00:31:14,070
I want Uncle.

250
00:31:14,070 --> 00:31:15,310
Uncle?

251
00:31:15,310 --> 00:31:22,710
Yes, I hope Santa tells Uncle not to go to Australia.

252
00:31:22,710 --> 00:31:23,800
Me, too.

253
00:31:23,800 --> 00:31:27,410
I want Uncle instead of clothes and shoes.

254
00:31:27,410 --> 00:31:29,490
Uncle said he's going to Australia?

255
00:31:30,680 --> 00:31:32,100
Don't worry.

256
00:31:32,100 --> 00:31:37,850
Since Galchi was good, Santa will tell him to stay.

257
00:31:37,850 --> 00:31:40,060
I'm not a kid.

258
00:31:40,060 --> 00:31:43,610
I know there's no Santa.

259
00:31:43,610 --> 00:31:46,620
No. Santa exists, stupid.

260
00:31:46,620 --> 00:31:47,980
Excuse me.

261
00:31:49,440 --> 00:31:53,140
I'm so tired.

262
00:31:53,140 --> 00:31:57,320
I guess I found the place.

263
00:31:57,320 --> 00:32:00,360
How have you been?

264
00:32:01,580 --> 00:32:03,170
Who are you?

265
00:32:03,170 --> 00:32:06,180
Don't I look familiar?

266
00:32:06,180 --> 00:32:06,990
Yes.

267
00:32:06,990 --> 00:32:11,740
I'm the mother of singer Choi Yun.
You saw me a lot on TV, right?

268
00:32:13,070 --> 00:32:15,740
Choi Yun visited us before as well.

269
00:32:15,740 --> 00:32:18,980
Really? Yun was here?

270
